---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Analytics from '../components/Analytics.astro';
import { SERVERS } from '../lib/servers';
---

<Layout
  title="Servidores CS2 — RandomPicks"
  description="Estado en directo de los servidores de CS2 de RandomPicks (Minigames y Surf), qué se juega en cada uno, cómo entrar, primeros comandos y a qué hora hay más gente."
>
  <nav>
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo-img-link">
        <img src="/random_picks_logo.jpg" alt="RandomPicks" style="height:44px;width:72px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;border-radius:8px;display:block;" />
      </a>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="/" data-i18n="nav-home">Inicio</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guias/" data-i18n="nav-guides">Guías</a></li>
        <li><a href="/mapas/" data-i18n="nav-maps">Mapas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/novedades/" data-i18n="nav-news">Novedades</a></li>
        <li><a href="/ranking/" data-i18n="nav-ranking">Ranking</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://discord.gg/HSMZT6njnk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="nav-discord">Discord</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://ko-fi.com/randompicks" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="nav-kofi" data-i18n="nav-kofi">☕ Apóyanos</a></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="nav-right">
        <button id="lang-toggle" class="lang-toggle" aria-label="Switch to English" title="Switch to English">
          <span class="lang-globe" aria-hidden="true">🌐</span>
          <span class="lang-es lang-active" id="lang-es">ES</span>
          <span class="lang-sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span>
          <span class="lang-en lang-inactive" id="lang-en">EN</span>
        </button>
        <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Menú" data-i18n-aria-label="menu-label" aria-controls="mobile-menu" aria-expanded="false">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobile-menu">
      <a href="/" data-i18n="nav-home">Inicio</a>
      <a href="/guias/" data-i18n="nav-guides">Guías</a>
      <a href="/mapas/" data-i18n="nav-maps">Mapas</a>
      <a href="/novedades/" data-i18n="nav-news">Novedades</a>
      <a href="/ranking/" data-i18n="nav-ranking">Ranking</a>
      <a href="https://discord.gg/HSMZT6njnk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a>
      <a href="https://ko-fi.com/randompicks" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="nav-kofi">☕ Apóyanos</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="rk-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="rk-orb rk-orb1"></div>
    <div class="rk-orb rk-orb2"></div>
    <div class="rk-grid-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <main class="servers-page">
    <header class="rk-header">
      <div class="section-tag" data-i18n="srv-tag">SERVIDORES</div>
      <h1 class="rk-title" data-i18n="srv-title">Nuestros servidores</h1>
      <p class="rk-sub" data-i18n="srv-sub">Estado en directo. Pulsa conectar y CS2 se abrirá directamente en el servidor.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="servers-grid">
      {SERVERS.map((s) => (
        <div class="server-card" data-server={s.id} data-state="loading">
          <div class="server-card-top">
            <span class="server-status">
              <span class="server-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="server-status-label" data-i18n="srv-loading">Comprobando…</span>
            </span>
            <span class="server-players"></span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="server-name">{s.name}</h3>
          <p class="server-mode" data-i18n={`srv-${s.id}-mode`} data-en={s.modeEn}>{s.mode}</p>
          <div class="server-map"></div>
          <div class="server-address"><code>{s.host}:{s.port}</code></div>
          <a class="server-connect" href={`steam://connect/${s.ip}:${s.port}`}>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            <span data-i18n="srv-connect">Conectar</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="servers-hint" data-i18n="srv-hint">Necesitas tener Steam y CS2 instalados. Si no se abre, copia la IP y escribe connect en la consola.</p>

    <!-- Texto largo en los dos idiomas: applyLang muestra el bloque del idioma activo -->
    <article class="srv-info" lang="es" data-lang-block="es">
      <h2>Qué hay en cada servidor</h2>
      <h3>Minigames · <code>cs2.randompicks.es:27015</code></h3>
      <p>
        El servidor principal, para hasta 20 jugadores. Cada mapa dura 16 minutos y al final se vota el siguiente
        entre los <a href="/mapas/">más de 70 mapas de la rotación</a>: courses (carreras de obstáculos por niveles),
        mapas de multijuegos y arenas, deathrun, Smash, minigolf y algunos de bhop y surf. Si el mapa no gusta, con
        <code>!rtv</code> se puede votar el cambio antes de tiempo.
      </p>
      <p>
        Los recorridos van cronometrados: tu mejor tiempo queda guardado en el <a href="/ranking/">ranking</a> y
        cuenta para los <a href="/novedades/#logros">logros</a>. Mientras juegas ganas créditos para la tienda de
        skins, estelas y alas; no se venden con dinero real.
      </p>
      <h3>Surf · <code>cs2.randompicks.es:27016</code></h3>
      <p>
        Solo surf, también para 20 jugadores, con mapas de <strong>tier 1 a 3</strong>: de los que sirven para
        aprender a los de dificultad media, sin los mapas técnicos que solo terminan los expertos. Cada mapa dura
        20 minutos. Tiene cronómetro, rangos, logros y la misma tienda que Minigames. Cuando se queda vacío un rato,
        vuelve solo a <code>surf_utopia_njv</code>, el mapa de surf más jugado de Workshop. La lista completa está
        en la <a href="/mapas/#surf">página de mapas</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cómo entrar</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Pulsa <strong>Conectar</strong> en la tarjeta del servidor. Steam abrirá CS2 y entrará directamente.</li>
        <li>
          Si no funciona, abre CS2, pon <em>Ajustes → Juego → Activar consola para desarrolladores (~)</em> en
          <em>Sí</em>, ábrela con la tecla que está a la izquierda del <kbd>1</kbd> (<kbd>º</kbd> en teclados
          españoles) y escribe <code>connect cs2.randompicks.es:27015</code>
          (o <code>:27016</code> para Surf).
        </li>
        <li>
          La primera vez que juegues un mapa, CS2 lo descarga de Workshop y la pantalla de carga puede tardar un poco
          más. Es normal; las siguientes veces ya lo tendrás.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        Todo el proceso, con soluciones si el mapa no carga, está en la guía
        <a href="/guias/como-conectarse/">cómo entrar a un servidor comunitario de CS2</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Primeros comandos</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Comando</th><th>Para qué sirve</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>!help</code></td><td>Menú con todos los comandos útiles: eliges uno y se ejecuta.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>!rtv</code> / <code>!nominate</code></td><td>Votar un cambio de mapa / proponer uno para la votación.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>!r</code></td><td>Volver al inicio del recorrido.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>!store</code></td><td>Abrir la tienda.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>!logros</code></td><td>Ver tus logros y lo que te falta para el siguiente.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Cuándo hay más gente</h2>
      <p>
        Los servidores están en Europa, así que desde España y el resto de Europa se juega con buen ping; desde
        América también se puede, aunque con algo más de latencia. Suele haber más movimiento por la tarde y la noche
        (hora peninsular española): en Minigames, sobre todo entre las 19:00 y las 22:00; en Surf, de 18:00 a
        medianoche y algo más los fines de semana. Si quieres jugar con más gente, en
        <a href="https://discord.gg/HSMZT6njnk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> se queda para entrar juntos.
      </p>

      <h2>Normas</h2>
      <p>
        Las de siempre: nada de insultos ni de trampas, y no estropear la partida a los demás a propósito. En
        minigames juega gente de todos los niveles y muchos están empezando. Si alguien se salta las normas, avisa
        a un administrador dentro del juego o en Discord.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="srv-info" lang="en" data-lang-block="en" hidden>
      <h2>What each server offers</h2>
      <h3>Minigames · <code>cs2.randompicks.es:27015</code></h3>
      <p>
        The main server, for up to 20 players. Each map lasts 16 minutes and at the end players vote the next one
        from the <a href="/mapas/">70+ maps in the rotation</a>: courses (obstacle runs split into levels),
        multigames and arena maps, deathrun, Smash, minigolf and a few bhop and surf maps. If nobody likes the map,
        <code>!rtv</code> starts an early vote to change it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Runs are timed: your best time is saved to the <a href="/ranking/">ranking</a> and counts towards
        <a href="/novedades/#logros">achievements</a>. Playing earns credits for the store's skins, trails and wings;
        they are never sold for real money.
      </p>
      <h3>Surf · <code>cs2.randompicks.es:27016</code></h3>
      <p>
        Surf only, also for 20 players, with <strong>tier 1 to 3</strong> maps: from beginner-friendly ones to
        medium difficulty, without the technical maps only experts finish. Each map lasts 20 minutes. It has a timer,
        ranks, achievements and the same store as Minigames. When it has been empty for a while it goes back to
        <code>surf_utopia_njv</code>, the most played surf map on the Workshop. The full list is on the
        <a href="/mapas/#surf">maps page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>How to join</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Hit <strong>Connect</strong> on the server card. Steam will open CS2 and join directly.</li>
        <li>
          If that doesn't work, open CS2, enable the console in <em>Settings → Game → Enable Developer Console</em>,
          open it with the key left of <kbd>1</kbd> (<kbd>~</kbd> on US keyboards) and type <code>connect cs2.randompicks.es:27015</code> (or <code>:27016</code> for Surf).
        </li>
        <li>
          The first time you play a map, CS2 downloads it from the Workshop, so loading can take a bit longer.
          That's normal; next time it will already be there.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        The full walkthrough, with fixes if a map doesn't load, is in our
        <a href="/guias/como-conectarse/">guide to joining a CS2 community server</a> (in Spanish).
      </p>

      <h2>First commands</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Command</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>!help</code></td><td>Menu with all the useful commands: pick one and it runs.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>!rtv</code> / <code>!nominate</code></td><td>Vote to change the map / suggest one for the vote.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>!r</code></td><td>Back to the start of the run.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>!store</code></td><td>Open the store.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>!logros</code></td><td>See your achievements and what's left for the next one.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>When it's busiest</h2>
      <p>
        The servers are in Europe, so ping is good from Spain and the rest of Europe; you can also play from the
        Americas with somewhat higher latency. It's usually busiest in the afternoon and evening (Spanish mainland
        time): on Minigames mostly between 19:00 and 22:00, on Surf from 18:00 to midnight and a bit more at weekends.
        To play with more people, players meet up on <a href="https://discord.gg/HSMZT6njnk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Rules</h2>
      <p>
        The usual ones: no insults, no cheating, and don't ruin the game for others on purpose. Players of every level
        join minigames and many are just starting. If someone breaks the rules, tell an admin in game or on Discord.
      </p>
    </article>

    <p class="rk-footnote rk-legal"><a href="/privacidad/" data-i18n="footer-privacy">Privacidad</a></p>
  </main>

  <Analytics />

  <script is:inline>
    var t = {
      es: {
        'footer-privacy': 'Privacidad', 'nav-home': 'Inicio', 'nav-guides': 'Guías', 'nav-maps': 'Mapas', 'nav-news': 'Novedades', 'nav-ranking': 'Ranking', 'nav-kofi': '☕ Apóyanos',
        'menu-label': 'Menú', 'srv-tag': 'SERVIDORES', 'srv-title': 'Nuestros servidores', 'srv-sub': 'Estado en directo. Pulsa conectar y CS2 se abrirá directamente en el servidor.', 'srv-loading': 'Comprobando…', 'srv-online': 'Online', 'srv-offline': 'Offline', 'srv-unknown': 'Estado no disponible', 'srv-connect': 'Conectar', 'srv-map': 'Mapa', 'srv-hint': 'Necesitas tener Steam y CS2 instalados. Si no se abre, copia la IP y escribe connect en la consola.',
      },
      en: {
        'footer-privacy': 'Privacy', 'nav-home': 'Home', 'nav-guides': 'Guides', 'nav-maps': 'Maps', 'nav-news': 'News', 'nav-ranking': 'Ranking', 'nav-kofi': '☕ Support us',
        'menu-label': 'Menu', 'srv-tag': 'SERVERS', 'srv-title': 'Our servers', 'srv-sub': 'Live status. Hit connect and CS2 will open straight into the server.', 'srv-loading': 'Checking…', 'srv-online': 'Online', 'srv-offline': 'Offline', 'srv-unknown': 'Status unavailable', 'srv-connect': 'Connect', 'srv-map': 'Map', 'srv-hint': 'You need Steam and CS2 installed. If it doesn\'t open, copy the IP and type connect in the console.',
      },
    };

    /* Textos por servidor: vienen de src/lib/servers.ts vía atributos del HTML */
    document.querySelectorAll('.server-mode').forEach(function(el) {
      var key = el.getAttribute('data-i18n');
      t.es[key] = el.textContent;
      t.en[key] = el.getAttribute('data-en');
    });

    function applyLang(lang) {
      var dict = t[lang];
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-i18n]').forEach(function(el) {
        var key = el.getAttribute('data-i18n');
        if (dict[key] !== undefined) el.textContent = dict[key];
      });
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-i18n-aria-label]').forEach(function(el) {
        var key = el.getAttribute('data-i18n-aria-label');
        if (dict[key] !== undefined) el.setAttribute('aria-label', dict[key]);
      });
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-lang-block]').forEach(function(el) {
        el.hidden = el.getAttribute('data-lang-block') !== lang;
      });
      var esEl = document.getElementById('lang-es');
      var enEl = document.getElementById('lang-en');
      var btn  = document.getElementById('lang-toggle');
      var on = lang === 'es' ? esEl : enEl, off = lang === 'es' ? enEl : esEl;
      on.classList.add('lang-active');   on.classList.remove('lang-inactive');
      off.classList.add('lang-inactive'); off.classList.remove('lang-active');
      var label = lang === 'es' ? 'Switch to English' : 'Cambiar a Español';
      btn.setAttribute('aria-label', label);
      btn.setAttribute('title', label);
      document.documentElement.setAttribute('lang', lang);
    }

    var currentLang = (function() {
      var s = null;
      try { s = localStorage.getItem('rp-lang'); } catch (_) {}
      if (s === 'es' || s === 'en') return s;
      return navigator.language.startsWith('es') ? 'es' : 'en';
    })();
    if (currentLang !== 'es') applyLang(currentLang);

    document.getElementById('lang-toggle').addEventListener('click', function() {
      currentLang = currentLang === 'es' ? 'en' : 'es';
      try { localStorage.setItem('rp-lang', currentLang); } catch (_) {}
      applyLang(currentLang);
    });

    var hamburger  = document.getElementById('hamburger');
    var mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobile-menu');
    hamburger.addEventListener('click', function() {
      var open = mobileMenu.classList.toggle('open');
      hamburger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
    });

    /* ESTADO DE SERVIDORES (/api/servers.json, cacheado 30 s en el servidor) */
    function setServerLabel(el, key) {
      el.setAttribute('data-i18n', key);
      el.textContent = t[currentLang][key];
    }
    function renderServers(list) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.server-card').forEach(function(card) {
        var st = null;
        for (var i = 0; list && i < list.length; i++) if (list[i].id === card.getAttribute('data-server')) st = list[i];
        var label   = card.querySelector('.server-status-label');
        var players = card.querySelector('.server-players');
        var map     = card.querySelector('.server-map');
        map.textContent = '';
        players.textContent = '';
        if (!st) {
          card.setAttribute('data-state', 'unknown');
          setServerLabel(label, 'srv-unknown');
        } else if (!st.online) {
          card.setAttribute('data-state', 'offline');
          setServerLabel(label, 'srv-offline');
        } else {
          card.setAttribute('data-state', 'online');
          setServerLabel(label, 'srv-online');
          if (typeof st.players === 'number' && typeof st.maxPlayers === 'number') players.textContent = st.players + ' / ' + st.maxPlayers;
          if (st.map) {
            var mapLabel = document.createElement('span');
            mapLabel.className = 'server-map-label';
            setServerLabel(mapLabel, 'srv-map');
            var mapName = document.createElement('code');
            mapName.textContent = st.map;
            map.appendChild(mapLabel);
            map.appendChild(mapName);
          }
        }
      });
    }
    function loadServers() {
      if (!document.querySelector('.server-card')) return;
      fetch('/api/servers.json', { headers: { 'Accept': 'application/json' } })
        .then(function(r) { if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status); return r.json(); })
        .then(function(d) { renderServers(d.servers); })
        .catch(function() { renderServers(null); });
    }
    loadServers();
    setInterval(function() { if (!document.hidden) loadServers(); }, 60000);
  </script>
</Layout>

<style>
  nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(10,10,15,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav-inner {
    max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;
    height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .logo-img-link { display: flex; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; list-style: none; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.2s; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .nav-discord { color: var(--discord) !important; border: 1px solid var(--discord); padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 6px; transition: background 0.2s !important; }
  .nav-discord:hover { background: var(--discord) !important; color: white !important; }
  .nav-kofi { color: var(--orange) !important; border: 1px solid var(--orange); padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 6px; transition: background 0.2s !important; }
  .nav-kofi:hover { background: var(--orange) !important; color: white !important; }
  .nav-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .lang-toggle {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 5px 11px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em; color: var(--text); transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s; outline: none;
  }
  .lang-toggle:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
  .lang-toggle:focus-visible { border-color: var(--orange); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,107,43,0.3); }
  .lang-globe { font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .lang-active { color: var(--text); }
  .lang-sep { color: var(--border); font-weight: 400; }
  .lang-inactive { color: var(--muted); transition: color 0.15s; }
  .lang-toggle:hover .lang-inactive { color: var(--text); }
  .hamburger { display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 4px; }
  .hamburger span { display: block; width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--text); border-radius: 2px; transition: 0.3s; }
  .mobile-menu { display: none; flex-direction: column; padding: 16px 24px 20px; gap: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .mobile-menu a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .mobile-menu.open { display: flex; }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    .hamburger { display: flex; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .lang-sep, .lang-inactive { display: none; }
    .lang-toggle { padding: 5px 9px; }
  }

  /* ── Fondo ── */
  .rk-bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: -1; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
  .rk-grid-overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #000 0%, transparent 70%);
  }
  .rk-orb { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(90px); opacity: 0.35; }
  .rk-orb1 { width: 520px; height: 520px; background: var(--orange); top: -260px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); opacity: 0.22; }
  .rk-orb2 { width: 420px; height: 420px; background: #5865F2; bottom: -200px; right: -120px; opacity: 0.12; }

  /* ── Cabecera ── */
  .servers-page { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 112px 24px 72px; }
  .rk-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease both; }
  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--orange);
    padding: 6px 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,107,43,0.35); border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255,107,43,0.08); margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .rk-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 30%, #b9b9d6);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
  }
  .rk-sub { color: var(--muted); max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; }

  /* ── Filtros ── */
  .rk-legal { margin-top: 12px; }
  .rk-legal a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
  .rk-legal a:hover { color: var(--text); }

